ions for that city and that city is added to the search history. When you view current weather conditions for that city, Then you be presented with the city name, the date, an icon representation of weather conditions, the temperature, the humidity, the wind speed, and the UV index. When you view the UV index, Then you will be presented with a color that indicates whether the conditions are favorable, moderate, or severe. When you view a future weather conditions for that city, Then  you will be  presented with a 5-day forecast that displays the date, an icon representation of weather conditions, the temperature, the wind speed, and the humidity. When you click on a city in the search history, Then you will be presented with current and future conditions for that city.","topics":[],"score":226556,"global_rank":125736},{"name":"apc518/spookr","owner":"apc518","html_url":"https://github.com/apc518/spookr","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"A spooky music generator. Come back here every October!","topics":["generative-music"],"score":226556,"global_rank":125737},{"name":"apc518/flippr","owner":"apc518","html_url":"https://github.com/apc518/flippr","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Flip musical notes around, useful for negative harmony tinkering","topics":["music-theory"],"score":226556,"global_rank":125738},{"name":"apc518/matheroids","owner":"apc518","html_url":"https://github.com/apc518/matheroids","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"Solve arithmetic problems to blow up asteroids","topics":["html5-canvas","html5-game"],"score":226556,"global_rank":125739},{"name":"JuanjoRamirez262/employee-tracker","owner":"JuanjoRamirez262","html_url":"https://github.com/JuanjoRamirez262/employee-tracker","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":226556,"global_rank":125743},{"